# Python bytecode. This repo gained its first committed .py files on 2026-09-13, when the inline
# Python in two workflows was extracted to scripts/ to make those workflows parse. Anyone who
# runs `python3 -m py_compile scripts/*.py` — the check that proves the extraction is valid —
# leaves a __pycache__ behind, so ignore it rather than have every such check dirty the tree.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
